'''Boston Breach''' was the team representing Boston, Massachusetts, USA, in the [[Call of Duty League]]. It was owned and operated by [[Oxygen Esports]] and Kraft Sports & Entertainment. The team was formed after the sale of the Chicago CDL slot and is the successor franchise to [[OpTic Chicago]].<ref name="boston cdl">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/OXG_Esports/status/1471186127377862668|title=We are joining forces with the @BostonUprising and welcoming Kraft Sports & Entertainment to the OXG family to establish New England as a global leader in esports.|author=[[Oxygen Esports]]}}</ref> On August 26th, 2026, [[M80]] announced that they had acquired the franchise slot moving the team to [[M80 Boston]]. <ref name"m80 boston"> {{cite web|url=https://x.com/M80Boston/status/2092659275004874844|title=boston, we're not going anywhere.|date=2026-08-26|author=[[M80 Boston]]}}</ref>.

