'''Carolina Royal Ravens''' (previously London Royal Ravens) is the team representing Charlotte, North Carolina, United States, in the [[Call of Duty League]]. The team is owned by [https://theinfinitereality.com Infinite Reality]. On October 6th, 2022, [[wikipedia:Rogue_(esports)|'''Rogue''']] announced a merger with [[leagueoflegends:KOI|'''KOI''']].<ref name="KOI-Rogue merger">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/KOI/status/1578111285010780160|title=Unimos fuerzas con Rogue y conquistaremos el mundo como KOI en 2023|author=[[leagueoflegends:KOI|KOI]]|date=2022-10-06}}</ref><ref name="Rogue-KOI merger">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Rogue/status/1578108813613625345|title=ROGUE AND KOI JOINING FORCES, We're ready to take the next step as an organization alongside KOI|author=[[wikipedia:Rogue_(esports)|Rogue]]|date=2022-10-06}}</ref>. On November 3rd, 2023, [[leagueoflegends:KOI|'''KOI''']] annouced that they and Infinite Reality have parted ways. <ref name="KOI and Infinite Reality part ways">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/KOI/status/1720569022431760802|title=Comunicado oficial.(Official Annoucement)|author=[[leagueoflegends:KOI|'''KOI''']]|date=2023-11-03}}</ref>.

