'''Fnatic''' (often stylized as '''FNATIC''' and abbreviated to '''FNC''') is a [[:Category:United Kingdom|British]] esports organization. Formed in 2004, Fnatic is an extremely storied organization that since its inception has become a mainstay in many competitive titles such as ''[[counterstrike:Fnatic|Counter-Strike]]'', ''[[leagueoflegends:Fnatic|League of Legends]]'' and ''[[valorant:Fnatic|VALORANT]]'' just to name a few.

