*September 26th - '''Fnatic''' replace [[zEnith]] with [[razMki]]. <ref name="zenith out, razmki in">{{cite web|url=http://gaming.fi/keskustelu.php?ketju_id=5102&kat_id=9998 |title=fnatic saa lisää kokemusta tiimiinsä |title_trans=Fnatic gets more experienced teammate |language={{Flag|fi}} Finnish |date=2010-09-26 |publisher='''Gaming.fi'''}}</ref>
